# Debug Mode Configuration
#
# Debug mode enables verbose logging for troubleshooting issues.
# When enabled, you'll see detailed per-product logs, weights, metadata, etc.
#
# USAGE:
# 1. Copy this file to 'debug.conf' (without .example)
# 2. Set to 'true' to enable debug logging
# 3. Set to 'false' for production mode (clean, minimal logging)
#
# Note: debug.conf is gitignored and won't be committed
#
# VALID VALUES: true, false, 1, 0, yes, no, on, off
false
